Breaks: The plugin's monitor runs a command the binary does not have, so it fails silently at every poll: a chat sitting idle is never told it has post, which is the only way in that needs no tool call.
Must fail: go test ./internal/cli -run '^TestThePluginOnlyInvokesCommandsThatExist$' -count=1

diff --git a/plugin/monitors/monitors.json b/plugin/monitors/monitors.json
